      "source": "Can be used natively, declaring several nested <a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> annotations.\nCan also be used in conjunction with Java 8's support for <em>repeatable annotations</em>,\nwhere <a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> can simply be declared several times on the same\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html#TYPE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\">type</a>, implicitly generating this container annotation.",
      "translation": "可以原生使用，声明多个嵌套的 <a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 注解。\n也可以与 Java 8 对<em>可重复注解</em>的支持结合使用，\n在这种情况下，可以在同一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/ElementType.html#TYPE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\">类型</a>上多次声明 <a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>，从而隐式生成该容器注解。",
